# Commit Message Template
# 
# Type: feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|test|chore
# Scope: (optional) what part of the codebase is affected
# 
# Subject: Brief description of the change (max 50 characters)
# 
# Body: More detailed explanation if needed (wrap at 72 characters)
# 
# Footer: References to issues, breaking changes, etc.
# 
# Examples:
# feat: add user authentication system
# fix: resolve database connection timeout
# docs: update API documentation
# 
# Remember: 
# - Use present tense ("add" not "added")
# - Use imperative mood ("move" not "moves")
# - Don't capitalize the first letter
# - No period at the end
